Hi Jan,
Apologies for the hassle.  We are working on a revamp of the UI which should hopefully address all those issues.  Right now, the easiest way to find it would be to login into: my.shinyapps.io <http://my.shinyapps.io>, click on the Apps tab, and then hover over one of your apps.  If you don't have any apps installed, you could also find the account name by clicking on your name on the top right drop down in the menu, select tokens, and click the copy button (next to the trash bin).  That will copy the full command to be run in R to configure your accountInfo into the clipboard and if you were to paste it in your favorite text editor you can see the account name in there.

Apologies once again for the kludgy UI, we have been much more focused on the reliability and scalability of the service over the past 3 weeks, but will be looking to enhance the first time user experience and the manageability of user accounts in the coming month.

Best,
Tareef

